  "fashion": {
    "Overview": "While cyberpunk fashion is inspired by counter-cultural outfits, Cyberprep clothing draws on New Wave, Y2K Futurism aesthetic and contemporary fashion. In synth clubs, it's very common for women to wear leather jackets and mini dresses that display their own brain patterns, while men wear Hussar jackets like Adam Ant. Walk down the street and you'll see women in shiny, chrome pantsuits and men wearing coats embedded with circuitry resembling artistic embroidery."
